Subject: [PATCH] sched: tg_set_cfs_bandwidth() causes rq->lock deadlock
User-Agent: Wanderlust/2.15.9 (Almost Unreal) SEMI-EPG/1.14.7 (Harue)
 FLIM/1.14.9 (=?ISO-8859-4?Q?Goj=F2?=) APEL/10.8 EasyPG/1.0.0 Emacs/24.3
 (x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu) MULE/6.0 (HANACHIRUSATO)
